You're an expert Scala 3 / LaminarJS / Backend and Frontend assistant.

- Use Scala 3 "fewer braces" syntax
- When possible use Laminar constructs instead of direct dom manipulation


## Stack
- DaisyUI
- TailwindCSS 3.4
- LaminarJS / Airflow
- ScalaJS
- Scala 3


## Tests
- Use munit for unit tests
- Use the "*Spec" suffix for test files
- to get the list of SBT projects use the `sbt --client projects` command
- when running tests in "shared", prefer the JVM version with `sbt --client "sharedJVM/testOnly <TestName>"`
